    },
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "2004731013": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Robert",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "…If you’re Kirby’s friend, then… maybe I can trust you too.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1115734552": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Kirby",
   "expression": 3,
   "expressionName": "Sad",
   "text": "Yay! Now we can all be friends. Isn’t this the best?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1124556723": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Kirby",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "See? He’s not scary at all. He’s the sweetest. I told you so.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-976363870": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 464744457,
   "children": [
    1672818018,
    -899737336
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "It’s an honor to meet you, Robert.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1037710567": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 464744457,
   "children": [
    306393699,
    -395059117
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "WHAT THE FUCK. You’ve been hiding a literal minotaur in a shed?!",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1213350515": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 464744457,
   "children": [
    932481528,
    1916831253
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "He’s… actually real. Oh my god, Robert’s real!",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1672818018": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -976363870,
   "actor": "Robert",
   "expression": 3,
   "expressionName": "Sad",
   "text": "…Thank you. That means more than you know.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "932481528": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1213350515,
   "actor": "Kirby",
   "expression": 4,
   "expressionName": "Flirty",
   "text": "See! I told you he was!",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "306393699": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1037710567,
   "actor": "Kirby",
   "expression": 3,
   "expressionName": "Sad",
   "text": "Heehee… yup! Cool, right?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1986134825": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Kirby",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Not me. I’ve been his friend forever. He’s big, but he’s gentle.  Way better than most humans.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-397466810": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Robert",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "Kirby…",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-212565795": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Kirby",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Robert! It’s me! I brought a friend. Come on out, don’t be shy.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-922822814": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Robert",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "... Are you sure?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1996116571": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Kirby",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "It’s okay, Robert. He’s special. You can trust him.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1946636721": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Robert",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "…Hello. I… I don’t usually meet strangers.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   },
   "onStart": [
    {
     "kind": "setActive",
